# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored.

# Production origin, no trailing slash. Drives canonical URLs, the sitemap,
# robots.txt, and Open Graph tags.
# Production value (confirmed by the client): https://www.greaterdata.com
# Leave this UNSET on Vercel preview deploys, so previews do not emit
# canonical URLs pointing at production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=

# Web3Forms access key for the /contact quote form.
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com.
#
# Register with sl@greaterdata.com — the client asked for quote requests to be
# delivered there. The destination is set in the Web3Forms dashboard, not in
# this repo, so changing it later does not need a code change.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ is required: the form posts from the browser, so this value is
# embedded in the client bundle and is publicly visible. That is how Web3Forms
# is designed to work — the key only permits submissions to your inbox, it does
# not grant access to past submissions. Configure allowed domains and spam
# protection in the Web3Forms dashboard.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
